  "content": "<h3>本模组增加了重新召唤暮色森林Boss的功能。（1.16.5 – 1.21.1）&nbsp;</h3><h3><br><strong>需要服务器？Kinetic Hosting 来帮忙！使用代码：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d624\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DIMAS</a></strong></h3><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d624\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong style=\"font-size:16px\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/916943/description_5a076ee1-7fb2-46ed-92c8-c340136e5aa5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"85\"></strong></a></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><strong>运作方式：</strong></h3><p><strong>击败Boss（娜迦、巫妖、九头蛇、奥迦斯、冰雪女王）后，一个特殊方块（基座）会在Boss战利品箱下方生成</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>你需要将击败Boss获得的战利品放在该方块上方。重要提示（1.16.5 – 1.19.2版本）：战利品方块必须朝北放置！！！</strong></span></p><p><strong>然后你需要用特定方块围成一个圆圈（如图例所示）</strong></p><p><strong>最后，右键点击基座即可！</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/735/627/image1.png\" alt=\"图例（以巫妖重生为例）\" width=\"484\" height=\"457\"></strong></p><p><strong>用于召唤Boss的环形方块可通过配置文件更改！</strong>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>默认环形方块：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>娜迦 - 铁木块</p>\n<p>巫妖 - 金块</p>\n<p>九头蛇 - 远古残骸</p>\n<p>奥迦斯 - <del>哭泣黑曜石（至1.20.1版本）</del> 骑士金属块</p>\n<p>冰雪女王 - <del>青金石块（至1.20.1版本）</del> 北极毛皮块</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/715/ds_loading.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"285\" height=\"190\"><br>也欢迎加入我们的Discord！<a href=\"https://discord.gg/xfBMY5RvwG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
